Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.34,0:00:07.39,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(2032,2112)}翻译/压制/字幕制作：HAF半个水果
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.74,0:00:10.50,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,大家好 欢迎回到我的主机
Dialogue: 2,0:00:07.74,0:00:10.50,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Hello everyone, and welcome back to my host machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.19,0:00:18.19,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(1912,1888)}使用AI工具翻译，如有不准确的地方请在弹幕或评论区指正，谢谢！
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.10,0:00:14.32,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我已经很久没有直接在上面录制视频了
Dialogue: 2,0:00:11.10,0:00:14.32,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I haven't made a video directly on it for quite a long time at this point.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.78,0:00:18.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,你可能注意到桌面小部件上显示的极端运行时长
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.78,0:00:18.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,You can probably notice the extreme uptime on the desktop widget,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.74,0:00:19.48,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这是有原因的
Dialogue: 2,0:00:18.74,0:00:19.48,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and it's for a reason.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.04,0:00:22.22,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,过去一年我一直在使用休眠功能
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.04,0:00:22.22,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I've been using hibernation for the past year,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.52,0:00:23.46,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,体验非常棒
Dialogue: 2,0:00:22.52,0:00:23.46,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and it's been beautiful.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.14,0:00:28.96,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我每晚都会休眠 所以运行时长会持续增长
Dialogue: 2,0:00:24.14,0:00:28.96,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The way the uptime is counted is the reason it keeps growing despite the fact I hibernate it every night.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.74,0:00:35.00,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1936,1466)}哦偶 我们遇到问题了
Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.74,0:00:35.00,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1941.333,1544)}And uh oh, we've got a problem here.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.58,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,今天我们来聊聊Windows更新
Dialogue: 2,0:00:36.52,0:00:38.58,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We're here to talk about Windows Update.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.58,0:00:42.62,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,尽管各种标题党和网络梗层出不穷
Dialogue: 2,0:00:39.58,0:00:42.62,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Despite all the clickbait media headlines and all the memes,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:42.78,0:00:44.92,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但我的系统配置至今还没被强制更新机制波及
Dialogue: 2,0:00:42.78,0:00:44.92,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,the vibe code hasn't yet caught up with my setup.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.88,0:00:47.68,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,说实话我可能只是运气好
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.88,0:00:47.68,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I might just honestly be lucky.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.02,0:00:48.96,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,几周前
Dialogue: 2,0:00:48.02,0:00:48.96,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So a couple weeks ago,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.02,0:00:52.70,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,在所有抱怨Windows更新无法修复问题的推文中
Dialogue: 2,0:00:49.02,0:00:52.70,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,among all the tweets complaining about the problems we cannot fix about Windows Update,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.26,0:00:55.80,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,基本上都是针对更新本身的问题
Dialogue: 2,0:00:53.26,0:00:55.80,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,basically, the updates themselves,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.00,0:01:01.16,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我看到一条推文有理有据地控诉了更新的强制性质
Dialogue: 2,0:00:56.00,0:01:01.16,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I saw one tweet complaining rightfully so about the forced nature of updates.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:01.90,0:01:05.08,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,具体来说 你越久不更新电脑
Dialogue: 2,0:01:01.90,0:01:05.08,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,As in the longer you go without updating your computer,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.62,0:01:08.14,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,微软就会剥夺越多的电源选项
Dialogue: 2,0:01:05.62,0:01:08.14,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,the more power options Microsoft is going to take away.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.88,0:01:13.70,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这对我来说不是新闻 但我从未真正深入探究过它的运作原理
Dialogue: 2,0:01:08.88,0:01:13.70,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's not news to me, but I never really cared to look under the hood to see how it actually works.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.34,0:01:17.44,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,于是在34天前那天
Dialogue: 2,0:01:14.34,0:01:17.44,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So that day, 34 days ago,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.54,0:01:19.44,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我决定停止安装更新
Dialogue: 2,0:01:17.54,0:01:19.44,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I decided to stop installing updates.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:19.72,0:01:20.38,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,彻底停止
Dialogue: 2,0:01:19.72,0:01:20.38,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Full stop.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:21.20,0:01:22.30,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,一段时间过去了
Dialogue: 2,0:01:21.20,0:01:22.30,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And it's been a while,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.54,0:01:29.46,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,他们确实剥夺了我直接关机和不更新重启的权利
Dialogue: 2,0:01:22.54,0:01:29.46,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and they did take away my rights to a plain shutdown and a plain restart without updating.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.92,0:01:34.56,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我终于开始探索修复微软制造的这个问题的办法
Dialogue: 2,0:01:30.92,0:01:34.56,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And I finally got to explore for a way to fix that problem Microsoft has created.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:36.74,0:01:38.32,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,抱歉黑屏了
Dialogue: 2,0:01:36.74,0:01:38.32,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the black screen.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.74,0:01:42.02,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,之前我一直猜测这肯定是个注册表键值
Dialogue: 2,0:01:38.74,0:01:42.02,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Before I was always guessing it must be a registry value
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.10,0:01:45.26,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,没错 确实是个注册表键值
Dialogue: 2,0:01:43.10,0:01:45.26,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And well, a registry value it is.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.28,0:01:47.04,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,其实是两个注册表键值
Dialogue: 2,0:01:45.28,0:01:47.04,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Actually two registry values.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.42,0:01:50.72,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它们位于HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE下
Dialogue: 2,0:01:47.42,0:01:50.72,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And they're located under HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:01.70,0:02:07.20,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,Windows更新编排器本质上是为电脑安装更新的服务
Dialogue: 2,0:02:01.70,0:02:07.20,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So the Windows Update Orchestrator is basically the service that installs updates to your computer.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.38,0:02:11.32,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这是管理所有安装任务的核心服务
Dialogue: 2,0:02:07.38,0:02:11.32,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's the main service that manages all the installs.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.74,0:02:13.06,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,在该注册表键内
Dialogue: 2,0:02:11.74,0:02:13.06,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Inside that registry key,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.16,0:02:16.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,有两个整数值分别名为EnhancedShutdownEnabled
Dialogue: 2,0:02:13.16,0:02:16.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,we have two integer values called EnhancedShutdownEnabled,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:16.70,0:02:19.64,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,当有待安装更新时该值设为1
Dialogue: 2,0:02:16.70,0:02:19.64,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which is set to 1 when there are updates pending install,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.14,0:02:24.54,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,否则为0 以及ShutdownFlyoutOptions
Dialogue: 2,0:02:20.14,0:02:24.54,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,and 0 otherwise, and ShutdownFlyoutOptions,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.64,0:02:26.46,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这是个4位位域值
Dialogue: 2,0:02:24.64,0:02:26.46,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which is a 4-bit bitfield.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:26.76,0:02:29.22,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这些数值完全没有官方文档说明
Dialogue: 2,0:02:26.76,0:02:29.22,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,These values are not documented at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.88,0:02:33.46,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1930.667,1594)}EnhancedShutdownEnabled默认并不存在
Dialogue: 2,0:02:29.88,0:02:33.46,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1930.667,1664)}EnhancedShutdownEnabled does not exist by default,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.69,0:02:38.68,Enderman-CN-C,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\pos(2000,1773.334)}对不起，有些烦人的劈啪声，它们是录音中突然出现的……
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.58,0:02:35.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1946.667,1591.333)}所以若想跳过更新安装
Dialogue: 2,0:02:33.58,0:02:35.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1946.667,1661.333)}so if you want to skip installing updates,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:36.06,0:02:36.82,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1976,1586)}直接删除即可
Dialogue: 2,0:02:36.06,0:02:36.82,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1976,1656)}just delete it.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.10,0:02:40.00,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1930.667,1591.333)}这是编排器注册表键的默认状态
Dialogue: 2,0:02:37.10,0:02:40.00,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1930.667,1661.333)}This is the default state of the Orchestrator registry key.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.48,0:02:44.28,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,ShutdownFlyoutOptions默认设为0
Dialogue: 2,0:02:41.48,0:02:44.28,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,ShutdownFlyoutOptions is set to 0 by default,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.66,0:02:48.88,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,若不想调整设置只需保持为0即可继续操作
Dialogue: 2,0:02:44.66,0:02:48.88,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,so set it to 0 if you don't want to mess around and you just want to move on.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.47,0:02:56.37,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,完成！
Dialogue: 2,0:02:55.47,0:02:56.37,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,There you go!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.09,0:02:59.94,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,现在可以不更新直接关机重启
Dialogue: 2,0:02:57.09,0:02:59.94,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,You can now shut down and restart without updating.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:00.35,0:03:03.11,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,如果您确实想调整设置 请继续听我说
Dialogue: 2,0:03:00.35,0:03:03.11,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,If you do want to mess around,stick with me.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:03.45,0:03:05.31,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,将其改回10
Dialogue: 2,0:03:03.45,0:03:05.31,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Set it back to 10.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.33,0:03:07.65,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,如前所述
Dialogue: 2,0:03:06.33,0:03:07.65,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,As already mentioned,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:07.93,0:03:10.09,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,ShutdownFlyoutOptions是一个4位位域
Dialogue: 2,0:03:07.93,0:03:10.09,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,ShutdownFlyoutOptions is a 4-bit bitfield.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.49,0:03:15.05,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这意味着它接受从0到15的所有数值
Dialogue: 2,0:03:10.49,0:03:15.05,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,That means it accepts values from 0 all the way up to 15.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:16.07,0:03:20.27,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,要理解其含义 需要将其转换为二进制格式
Dialogue: 2,0:03:16.07,0:03:20.27,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And to make sense, it needs to be converted into the binary format.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:20.75,0:03:23.23,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,让我快速调出对照表
Dialogue: 2,0:03:20.75,0:03:23.23,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let me pull up the table real quick.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.73,0:03:25.67,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 2,0:03:24.73,0:03:25.67,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:26.65,0:03:31.61,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这里展示了前15个十进制数对应的十六进制与二进制转换
Dialogue: 2,0:03:26.65,0:03:31.61,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So these are the first 15 decimal numbers converted into hexadecimal and binary,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.83,0:03:32.25,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,基本上就是这样
Dialogue: 2,0:03:31.83,0:03:32.25,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,basically.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.25,0:03:37.37,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这里的A代表十进制中的10
Dialogue: 2,0:03:32.25,0:03:37.37,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We've got A here, which represents the 10 in decimal.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.39,0:03:42.17,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,而二进制表示实际上是1010
Dialogue: 2,0:03:38.39,0:03:42.17,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And in binary, it's actually 1010.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.85,0:03:44.51,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,那么这到底意味着什么呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:03:42.85,0:03:44.51,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So what the hell does that mean?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.71,0:03:49.33,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们需要从高位到低位进行解析
Dialogue: 2,0:03:45.71,0:03:49.33,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We're going to have to go from the high order to the low order bit,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.71,0:03:52.47,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,基本上就是从左到右来看
Dialogue: 2,0:03:49.71,0:03:52.47,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,basically from left to right for what it's worth.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.69,0:03:55.01,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我需要快速腾出一些空间
Dialogue: 2,0:03:52.69,0:03:55.01,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I need to make some extra space here real quick,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:55.09,0:03:55.43,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,稍等
Dialogue: 2,0:03:55.09,0:03:55.43,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,hold on.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.35,0:04:02.47,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,让我们标记一下位的读取方向
Dialogue: 2,0:03:56.35,0:04:02.47,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's just mark the direction the bits are going.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:03.41,0:04:06.79,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它是这样的
Dialogue: 2,0:04:03.41,0:04:06.79,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And it goes like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.21,0:04:11.67,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,第一位代表更新并关机按钮
Dialogue: 2,0:04:07.21,0:04:11.67,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The first bit is the Update and Shutdown button.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.51,0:04:16.07,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们就称它为US
Dialogue: 2,0:04:12.51,0:04:16.07,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So we'll just call it US,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.25,0:04:17.23,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,更新并关机
Dialogue: 2,0:04:16.25,0:04:17.23,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Update and Shutdown.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:17.83,0:04:20.97,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,第二位是普通关机
Dialogue: 2,0:04:17.83,0:04:20.97,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The second bit is Plain Shutdown.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.15,0:04:22.19,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,称为S
Dialogue: 2,0:04:21.15,0:04:22.19,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's call it S.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:23.35,0:04:26.87,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,第三位是更新并重启
Dialogue: 2,0:04:23.35,0:04:26.87,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The third bit is Update and Restart.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.05,0:04:28.07,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,称为UR
Dialogue: 2,0:04:27.05,0:04:28.07,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's call it UR.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.15,0:04:34.11,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,最后一位是普通重启
Dialogue: 2,0:04:30.15,0:04:34.11,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And the final bit is Plain Restart.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.07,0:04:37.83,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这就是这个位域所代表的值
Dialogue: 2,0:04:35.07,0:04:37.83,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So these are the values the bit field represents.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:38.55,0:04:40.11,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但它们实际意味着什么？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:38.55,0:04:40.11,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But what do they actually mean?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.35,0:04:43.35,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,当设置为0时会发生什么？设置为1时又会怎样？
Dialogue: 2,0:04:40.35,0:04:43.35,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,What happens when it's set to zero and what happens when it's set to one?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.77,0:04:47.81,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,那么更新位 比如更新并关机和更新并重启
Dialogue: 2,0:04:43.77,0:04:47.81,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So the Update bits, let's say Update and Shutdown and Update and Restart,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.23,0:04:53.29,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它们直接控制更新电源选项按钮的可见性
Dialogue: 2,0:04:48.23,0:04:53.29,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,they directly control the visibility of the Update power option buttons.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.23,0:04:56.19,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,所以更新并关机和更新并重启
Dialogue: 2,0:04:54.23,0:04:56.19,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So Update and Shutdown and Update and Restart,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.29,0:04:58.01,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,直接由这些位控制
Dialogue: 2,0:04:56.29,0:04:58.01,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,they're directly controlled by those bits.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.65,0:05:01.87,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,每当第一位设置为1时
Dialogue: 2,0:04:58.65,0:05:01.87,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So whenever the first bit is set to one,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:02.43,0:05:05.09,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,更新并关机就会显示在电源菜单中
Dialogue: 2,0:05:02.43,0:05:05.09,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Update and Shutdown shows in the power menu.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.83,0:05:07.63,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,每当第三位设置为1时
Dialogue: 2,0:05:05.83,0:05:07.63,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Whenever the third bit is set to one,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.13,0:05:11.45,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,总会显示更新并重启选项
Dialogue: 2,0:05:08.13,0:05:11.45,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,it always shows the Update and Restart option.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:11.89,0:05:13.13,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但普通位
Dialogue: 2,0:05:11.89,0:05:13.13,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The Plain bits though,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:13.63,0:05:15.81,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,即关机和重启位
Dialogue: 2,0:05:13.63,0:05:15.81,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,the Shutdown and the Restart bits,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.91,0:05:16.75,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,第二位和第四位
Dialogue: 2,0:05:15.91,0:05:16.75,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,the bits two and four,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.63,0:05:20.57,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它们控制着普通电源选项的可见性
Dialogue: 2,0:05:17.63,0:05:20.57,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,they control the visibility of the Plain power options,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.01,0:05:23.25,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,即不进行更新的关机和重启
Dialogue: 2,0:05:21.01,0:05:23.25,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,as in Shutdown and Restart without updating,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.85,0:05:25.93,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,当更新电源选项存在时
Dialogue: 2,0:05:23.85,0:05:25.93,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,when the Update power options are present.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:26.35,0:05:28.17,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,每当这些位设置为1时
Dialogue: 2,0:05:26.35,0:05:28.17,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So whenever these bits are set to one,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.55,0:05:29.53,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这些实际上很重要
Dialogue: 2,0:05:28.55,0:05:29.53,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,these actually matter.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.17,0:05:35.27,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,因此我们或许可以排除这里的几个值
Dialogue: 2,0:05:31.17,0:05:35.27,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So we can probably exclude a couple values from here,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.31,0:05:43.53,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,它们会重复 因为实际上它并不能控制普通电源选项的可见性
Dialogue: 2,0:05:35.31,0:05:43.53,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which are going to repeat because it doesn't actually control the visibility of the Plain power options whenever the
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.53,0:05:44.88,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,尤其是在更新选项不存在的时候
Dialogue: 2,0:05:43.53,0:05:44.88,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Update options aren't present.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.31,0:05:46.81,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,希望我解释清楚了
Dialogue: 2,0:05:45.31,0:05:46.81,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I hope that made sense,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.89,0:05:49.57,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但这确实很难解释清楚
Dialogue: 2,0:05:46.89,0:05:49.57,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but it's kind of really difficult to explain.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.35,0:05:53.39,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,比如 我电脑上现在显示的是什么？
Dialogue: 2,0:05:50.35,0:05:53.39,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So for example, what do we have here on my computer right now?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.47,0:05:54.09,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,是10
Dialogue: 2,0:05:53.47,0:05:54.09,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,We have 10.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.75,0:05:56.37,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,设置为A或10
Dialogue: 2,0:05:54.75,0:05:56.37,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's set to A or 10.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.93,0:05:58.11,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,你猜怎么着？
Dialogue: 2,0:05:56.93,0:05:58.11,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And what do you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.63,0:06:00.31,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,第一位和第三位被设为1
Dialogue: 2,0:05:58.63,0:06:00.31,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Bits one and three are set to one.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.97,0:06:02.05,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,所以本质上就是
Dialogue: 2,0:06:00.97,0:06:02.05,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So essentially it's one,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:02.11,0:06:02.83,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,1,0,1,0
Dialogue: 2,0:06:02.11,0:06:02.83,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,zero, one, zero.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.33,0:06:04.79,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,第一位和第三位设为1
Dialogue: 2,0:06:03.33,0:06:04.79,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Bits one and three are set to one,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.89,0:06:08.53,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这意味着有“更新并关机”选项
Dialogue: 2,0:06:04.89,0:06:08.53,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which means I'm going to have Update and Shutdown.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.89,0:06:11.29,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,有“更新并重启”选项
Dialogue: 2,0:06:08.89,0:06:11.29,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I'm going to have Update and Restart set.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.29,0:06:16.73,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,而“直接关机”和“直接重启”会隐藏 因为它们的位被设为0
Dialogue: 2,0:06:11.29,0:06:16.73,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And the Plain Shutdown and the Plain Restart are going to be invisible because they're set to zero.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:17.25,0:06:19.19,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,那么开始菜单里会显示什么？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:17.25,0:06:19.19,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So what do we have in the Start menu?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.33,0:06:22.55,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这正是位字段所指示的
Dialogue: 2,0:06:19.33,0:06:22.55,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, that's exactly what the bit field says.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.17,0:06:26.51,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,如果我们设为11
Dialogue: 2,0:06:24.17,0:06:26.51,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,If we set it to 11, let's say,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.97,0:06:29.41,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,就意味着重启按钮会显示
Dialogue: 2,0:06:26.97,0:06:29.41,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,that means the Restart button is going to show.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.57,0:06:30.81,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,直接重启按钮会显示
Dialogue: 2,0:06:29.57,0:06:30.81,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The Plain Restart button is going to show.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.93,0:06:32.39,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,试试设为B
Dialogue: 2,0:06:30.93,0:06:32.39,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's try setting it to B,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.51,0:06:34.07,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,也就是十进制的11
Dialogue: 2,0:06:32.51,0:06:34.07,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,which is 11 in decimal.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.25,0:06:37.25,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,你猜怎么着？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:36.25,0:06:37.25,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And what do you know?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.31,0:06:39.49,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,重启按钮现在出现在开始菜单了
Dialogue: 2,0:06:37.31,0:06:39.49,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,The Restart button is now in the Start menu.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.69,0:06:43.01,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,对 基本就是这样运作的
Dialogue: 2,0:06:40.69,0:06:43.01,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So yeah, that's how it basically works.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.11,0:06:44.61,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,当我们设为15时
Dialogue: 2,0:06:43.11,0:06:44.61,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Whenever we set it to 15,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:44.85,0:06:47.59,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,就会显示所有按钮
Dialogue: 2,0:06:44.85,0:06:47.59,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,let's say, it's going to show every single button.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.49,0:06:50.01,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,看吧
Dialogue: 2,0:06:49.49,0:06:50.01,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Boom.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.69,0:06:52.24,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,现在有了“更新并关机”
Dialogue: 2,0:06:50.69,0:06:52.24,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Now we've got Update and Shutdown,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.24,0:06:54.26,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,“直接关机”“更新并重启”和“直接重启”
Dialogue: 2,0:06:52.24,0:06:54.26,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Shutdown, Update, and Restart,and Restart.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.43,0:06:56.37,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,完全符合位字段的设置
Dialogue: 2,0:06:54.43,0:06:56.37,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Just like the bit field states.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:57.23,0:06:58.63,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,当设为0时
Dialogue: 2,0:06:57.23,0:06:58.63,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Whenever we set it to zero,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.89,0:07:02.31,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,就会恢复默认状态 因为这是正常行为
Dialogue: 2,0:06:58.89,0:07:02.31,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,it just resets to normal because that's the normal behavior.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.41,0:07:04.46,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这是位字段的默认行为
Dialogue: 2,0:07:02.41,0:07:04.46,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,That's the default behavior for the bit field.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:08.79,0:07:14.35,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,我们还可以试试设为3作为例子
Dialogue: 2,0:07:08.79,0:07:14.35,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And, I mean, we can probably try setting it to 3 as an example.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.09,0:07:17.09,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这样会显示“更新并重启”
Dialogue: 2,0:07:15.09,0:07:17.09,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,It's going to have Update and Restart,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.57,0:07:19.19,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但没有直接重启按钮
Dialogue: 2,0:07:17.57,0:07:19.19,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,but have no Restart button.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.43,0:07:20.11,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,来试试看
Dialogue: 2,0:07:19.43,0:07:20.11,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Let's try that.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.49,0:07:22.57,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,设为3 看看会发生什么
Dialogue: 2,0:07:20.49,0:07:22.57,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Set it to 3, see what happens.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:23.45,0:07:30.11,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1904,1759.333)}现在确实有直接关机按钮了 因为“更新并关机”按钮不存在
Dialogue: 2,0:07:23.45,0:07:30.11,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1904,1829.333)}We do have the Shutdown button now because the Update and Shutdown button does not exist.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.17,0:07:35.69,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,而且直接关机按钮的可见性不再受位字段控制
Dialogue: 2,0:07:31.17,0:07:35.69,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And the visibility of the Shutdown button is not controlled by the bit field anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.61,0:07:39.71,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,但现在显示了“更新并重启”和“直接重启”按钮
Dialogue: 2,0:07:36.61,0:07:39.71,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But we now have Update and Restart and Restart shown.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.07,0:07:42.27,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这挺有意思的
Dialogue: 2,0:07:41.07,0:07:42.27,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,That's quite interesting.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.41,0:07:45.81,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,现在设为2 就只会显示“直接关机”和“更新并重启”
Dialogue: 2,0:07:42.41,0:07:45.81,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Now let's set it to 2 and it's going to be Shutdown and Update and Restart only.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.17,0:07:47.33,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 2,0:07:47.17,0:07:47.33,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.75,0:07:50.61,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,总之 如果想彻底移除更新选项
Dialogue: 2,0:07:47.75,0:07:50.61,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,But anyway, if you do want to get rid of the updates,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:50.85,0:07:58.59,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,将关机菜单选项设为零并删除EnhancedShutdownEnabled的注册表值
Dialogue: 2,0:07:50.85,0:07:58.59,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,you just need to set the Shutdown flyout options to zero and delete the Enhanced Shutdown Enabled registry value.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:59.41,0:08:00.39,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,这样就完成了
Dialogue: 2,0:07:59.41,0:08:00.39,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,And there you go.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:00.75,0:08:04.97,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1925.333,1524.667)}现在你拥有了干净清爽的开始菜单电源选项
Dialogue: 2,0:08:00.75,0:08:04.97,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1925.333,1594.667)}You've got yourself a clean Start menu power options menu.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:05.79,0:08:06.27,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,搞定
Dialogue: 2,0:08:05.79,0:08:06.27,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.31,0:08:08.71,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,以上就是具体操作方法
Dialogue: 2,0:08:07.31,0:08:08.71,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,So yeah, that's how it works.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.19,0:08:10.31,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,希望你喜欢这个视频
Dialogue: 2,0:08:09.19,0:08:10.31,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,I hope you enjoyed the video.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.03,0:08:12.83,Newman2-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,感谢观看 保重
Dialogue: 2,0:08:11.03,0:08:12.83,Newman2-EN-4K,,0,0,0,,Thanks for watching and take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.59,0:08:33.14,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur30\fad(200,200)\fscx185\fscy188\pos(1901.335,773.333)}在 Youtube 上关注
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.78,0:08:33.14,Newman-CN-4K,,0,0,0,,{\blur10\fad(200,200)\pos(1895.619,1483.047)}原标题：Disable Forced Windows Update in Windows 11 原作者：Enderman\N原视频上传日期：2026年2月15日\N翻译/压制/字幕制作：HAF半个水果\N\N字幕制作不易，喜欢的话支持一下我吧！
